iv style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><label style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 16px; min-height: 52px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); border-radius: 14px; cursor: pointer; opacity: 1; transition: border-color 150ms, background 150ms;"><input style="accent-color: var(--ac); width: 20px; height: 20px; cursor: inherit; flex-shrink: 0;" type="checkbox" name="opt-g"><span style="flex: 1 1 0%; min-width: 0px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--tx);">Queso</span><span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: var(--t2); flex-shrink: 0;">+$150</span></label></div></fieldset></div><div style="padding: 24px 22px 0px;"><h3 style="margin: 0px 0px 6px; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 20px; color: var(--tx);">Notas para la cocina</h3><p class="body-s" style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 12px;">Algo que tengamos en cuenta. Hacemos lo posible — no garantizamos cambios mayores.</p><textarea placeholder="Sin sal · cocción jugosa · sin cebolla…" maxlength="140" style="width: 100%; min-height: 80px; padding: 14px; resize: none; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg); color: var(--tx); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; outline: none;"></textarea><div style="text-align: right; font-size: 11px; color: var(--t3); margin-top: 4px;">0/140</div></div><div style="padding: 32px 22px 0px;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 14px;"><h3 style="margin: 0px; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 20px; color: var(--tx);">Qué dicen</h3></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; padding: 16px 18px; background: var(--b2); border-radius: 14px;"><div><div style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 36px; line-height: 1; color: var(--tx);">4.3</div><div class="body-s" style="font-size: 11px; margin-top: 4px;">133 opiniones</d